  "title": "Chocolate Chip Orange Zucchini Bread",
  "description": "This chocolate chip orange zucchini bread recipe combines the flavors and textures of orange, zucchini, chocolate chips, and chopped nuts in two loaves.",
  "authors": [
    "Jules Paulus"
  ],
